Row=figma.createFrame(); headRow.layoutMode=\"HORIZONTAL\"; headRow.itemSpacing=24; headRow.fills=[];\nheadRow.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; headRow.counterAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; headRow.counterAxisAlignItems=\"CENTER\";\nconst cta=text(\"I'd be thrilled to hear about your next project\",{size:56,style:\"Bold\",color:C.ink});\nheadRow.appendChild(cta);\n// icon\nconst iconComp=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(ICON_RIGHT_ID);\nconst icon=iconComp.createInstance(); icon.resize(44,44); icon.name=\"Icon_Arrow_Right\";\n// recolor accent: find vectors\nfor(const v of icon.findAll(n=>n.type===\"VECTOR\"||n.type===\"BOOLEAN_OPERATION\")){v.fills=solid(C.accent);}\nheadRow.appendChild(icon);\ncb.appendChild(headRow);\n// links row\nconst row=figma.createFrame(); row.layoutMode=\"HORIZONTAL\"; row.itemSpacing=48; row.fills=[];\nrow.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; row.counterAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; row.counterAxisAlignItems=\"CENTER\";\nconst email=text(\"deniz.arslan@example.com\",{size:20,style:\"Medium\",color:C.accent}); email.name=\"Email\"; email.textDecoration=\"UNDERLINE\";\nrow.appendChild(email);\nconst sep? maybe bullet. \nconst resume=text(\"View Resume\",{size:20,style:\"Medium\",color:C.ink}); resume.name=\"Resume\"; \nrow.appendChild(resume);\ncb.appendChild(row);\n```\nHmm headline 56px with icon inline. Might look fine. Maybe headline width wrap: two lines? \"I'd be thrilled to hear about\" newline \"your next project →\"? Single line at 56px DM Sans bold ~ characters 46 × ~28px ≈ 1290px wide — too wide for 1308 content? Close. Set 48px → ~1100px + icon 44 + gap. OK 48.\n\nPositioning components below: track y cursor.\n\nThen Call C builds 01_Work:\n\n```js\nconst work=figma.createFrame(); work.name=\"01_Work\";\nwork.layoutMode=\"VERTICAL\"; work.itemSpacing=0; work.fills=solid(C.bg);\nwork.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; work.counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\";\nwork.resize(1440,100);\nwork.clipsContent=false;\npage.appendChild(work); work.x=0; work.y=0;\n// header\nconst headerSet=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(HEADER_SET_ID);\nconst header=headerSet.createInstance(); // default variant = first = Current=Work\nheader.setProperties({\"Current\":\"Work\"});\nwork.appendChild(header);\n```\n\nHmm: ComponentSetNode.createInstance exists? Yes. And defaultVariant is first added. I'll setProperties anyway.\n\nIntro section:\n```js\nconst intro=figma.createFrame(); intro.name=\"Intro\";\nintro.layoutMode=\"VERTICAL\"; intro.fills=[]; \nintro.paddingLeft=96; intro.paddingRight=96; intro.paddingTop=150; intro.paddingBottom=120;\nintro.itemSpacing=40;\nintro.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; intro.counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\";\nintro.resize(1308,100); // width fixed 1308? use 1440-192=1248... \n```\nHmm I want intro width = work width, padding 96 inside. Set intro counterAxis FIXED width 1440? In vertical parent, child frame width: set intro.layoutAlign=\"STRETCH\" then width = parent width; but counterAxisSizingMode FIXED conflicts — use layoutAlign STRETCH and set counterAxisSizingMode FIXED won't allow stretch. Simplest: intro.resize(1440, intro.height) with counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\" and width 1440. Then padding handles margins.\n\nIntro content:\n- eyebrow: \"PORTFOLIO ⏤ 2020\"? Not required; skip extra. Keep required copy only? \"Everything in 'Must include' must appear\" — extras allowed. I'll add small label \"3D ARTIST & SCULPTOR\" eyebrow above Hello? Nice for hierarchy: eyebrow \"PORTFOLIO — 3D MODELING & TEXTURING\". Keep minimal: \n- h1 text(\"Hello, I'm Deniz.\", 92 Bold ink)\n- sub text(\"A senior-year design student who is trying to specialize in 3D modeling & texturing.\", 24 Regular gray lh 36, width 640)\n- scroll cue row: Icon_Arrow_Down instance 24 recolored gray + text \"Scroll to explore\" 13 Medium gray caps ls 2. Row horizontal spacing 12, counter center. Margin top extra: intro.itemSpacing 40 then cue maybe 80 gap → add spacer frame (transparent rect 1×40)? Simpler: put cue in its own container with paddingTop 40.\n\nProjects section:\n```js\nconst projects=figma.createFrame(); projects.name=\"Projects\";\nvertical, padding 96 left/right, paddingTop 40, paddingBottom 140, itemSpacing 96, width 1440 fixed, fill none.\n```\nAdd section header: text(\"SELECTED WORK\",{13 Medium gray ls 2}) + divider line full width (1308). A row? Just add label then line (line width 1308 fixed) — inside vertical layout with children widths: label, line, then blocks.\n\nThen for each project i: instance of pb; overrides:\np1: default (already Goblin Bust). keep.\np2: Number \"02\", Title \"Skin Shader Study\", Desc \"Subsurface weight, specular roughness and diffuse maps generated with procedural and manual techniques.\", Tools visible=false, Link \"See case study →\".\np3: Number \"03\", Title \"Creature Concept\", Desc \"Experimental creature modeling for a school project.\", Tools visible=false, Link visible=false, Status visible=true.\n\nDividers between projects: after each block except last add hline(1308)? itemSpacing uniform 96; divider then next block also 96. Fine, add divider lines between (2 dividers).\n\nThen footer instance at end.\n\nCall D: 02_About:\n```js\nconst about=figma.createFrame(); name \"02_About\"; vertical; width 1440 fixed; bg fill; x=1600,y=0;\nheader instance setProperties Current=About.\n```\nIntro section: horizontal layout? heading left column + photo right.\n```js\nconst intro=frame vertical padding(96) top150 bottom120 itemSpacing 56 width1440.\n// top row horizontal: textCol(vertical, spacing 28, width ~760) + photo\nconst row=horizontal, itemSpacing 120, width fill? children: textCol, photoInst.\ntextCol: eyebrow \"ABOUT\" 13 gray ls2; h1 \"Hi, I'm Deniz Arslan, 3D artist & sculptor.\" 52 Bold ink lh 62 width 720 (wrap 2 lines); bio1 text 17 Regular gray lh30 width 640; bio2 same.\nphoto: Photo_Profile instance resize(424,595); cornerRadius? Instances support cornerRadius? InstanceNode has cornerRadius yes. Set 8.\n```\nBio text: \n1. \"My work is mainly focused on 3D modeling, texturing and rendering. I like exploring creatures with a touch of dark surrealism for characters and production.\"\n2. \"Now I'm an interactive media design student in Istanbul ⏤ currently freelancing and seeking internship opportunities.\"\n\nSkills section: horizontal two SkillGroup instances, gap 160, padding same 96, top divider? Section: label \"SKILLS\"? The must-include: 'Skills: \"Main Software\" and \"Main Skills\", each with its list'. Titles in SkillGroup. \n\nskillsSection: vertical: divider line 1308, spacer, row horizontal itemSpacing 200 with two instances (each 520 wide → 520+520+200=1240 < 1308 ok).\nInstance2 overrides: Title \"MAIN SKILLS\", Items \"Organic and Polygonal Modeling\\nUV Layout\\nTexturing\\nRetopology\\nIllustration\\nSound Design\".\n\nContact section: divider + ContactBlock instance, padding 96 bottom 160.\n\nFooter instance.\n\nCall E: prototype reactions.\n\nReactions on header component internals (so both variants): for each variant (hWork, hAbout nodes): \n- Logo text → destinationId workFrame\n- Nav_Work (the nav item frame or its text) → workFrame\n- Nav_About → aboutFrame (only required in Work variant; adding in both harmless but brief says only what's listed; About self-link not listed — could still navigate to itself; harmless but let me only add: in Work variant: About→about, Logo→work, Work→work. In About variant: Logo→work, Work→work.)\n\nSet reaction on the nav item frame (navItem frame name \"Nav_About\") — bigger click target.\n\nReactions API: node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\",duration:{...}}...}}]. Simplest known-good: \n```js\nnode.reactions=[{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:target.id,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:null,presetDuration:0.2? }}]\n```\nActually the modern action shape: {type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition: null, preserveScrollPosition:false, overlayRelativePosition:null, resetVideoPosition:false, resetScrollPosition:false, resetInteractiveComponents:false}. Extra fields probably optional. I'll include preserveScrollPosition:false and transition null.\n\nFlow starting point: page.flowStartingPoints = [{nodeId: work.id, name:\"01_Work\"}] — try/catch.\n\nAlso verify: read back reactions count.\n\nCall F: screenshots of 01_Work and 02_About. Fix as needed.\n\nPotential font issue: DM Sans must be available in Figma's font library — it's a Google font, should be present.\n\nNote letterSpacing for caps labels: {unit:\"PIXELS\", value:2}.\n\nOne more: textCase \"UPPER\" — I'll type caps directly in strings to avoid issues, or use textCase. Direct caps simpler.\n\nAlso: \"Deniz Arslan ⏤ 2020\" uses ⏤ (U+2E4F). Must ensure DM Sans has that glyph; if missing it may render as fallback box. Risk. The brief itself uses ⏤. If DM Sans lacks it... DM Sans may not include U+2E4F. Safer? The must-include says \"Deniz Arslan ⏤ 2020\" — use verbatim. If glyph missing in DM Sans, Figma falls back to another font for that glyph, displays fine. Keep verbatim. Same for Istanbul ⏤.\n\nAlright, also the arrow chars ↗ (U+2197) and → (U+2192) — DM Sans includes arrows generally. OK.\n\nLet me also double check instance text override: need font loaded (done). findOne on instance children allowed. Setting characters on instance child text allowed.\n\nAlso resizing instance of ImagePlaceholder: component fixed size 620×420; instance resize works.\n\nPhoto instance resize to 424×595: allowed.\n\nIcon instance resize: vector inside will scale via constraints; icons are vectors with constraints scale typically. resize 24→44 ok.\n\nAlso recolor icon: findAll VECTOR set fills accent.\n\nFor scroll cue icon: recolor gray.\n\nLet me write Call A now. Keep code under 50000 chars; each call ~4-6k chars fine.\n\nOne concern: combineAsVariants requires nodes on same parent and they get wrapped; also component property name becomes \"Current\" with values \"Work\"/\"About\" since names \"Current=Work\"/\"Current=About\".\n\nLet me also make sure page 4:2 is empty so no conflicts.\n\nGo.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"553987d8-b007-418a-a3bc-0985cd9e3afc","uuid":"c40b6928-2917-4372-9518-034c834dcc44","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:41:49.178Z","thinking_duration_ms":299920}
